  "comments": [
    {
      "object": "table public.ca_ledger_audit_bbj_pool",
      "comment": "Per BBJ pool opened after the epoch: journalled seeds (into the pool, not a contribution) and burns (out of the pool, not a payout or promo) over the bbj_epoch range of ca_ledger_audit_marks, and the legs its opening absorbed (epoch, absorbed_to], once absorbed_to (the opening) is older than the range, as fn_bbj_conservation_check counts them. Migration 20261022162545."
    },
    {
      "object": "table public.ca_ledger_audit_marks",
      "comment": "How far the hourly conservation sweep has summed chip_ledger. chip_drift: player wallet legs with from_at <= created_at < through_at, per member in ca_ledger_audit_member_net (from_at = min(ca_chip_baseline.taken_at)). bbj_epoch: BBJ pool legs with from_at < created_at < through_at, to_total/from_total over every pool and per later pool in ca_ledger_audit_bbj_pool (from_at = the BBJ epoch). Written only by fn_ca_ledger_audit_checkpoint_advance. Migration 20261022162545."
    },
    {
      "object": "table public.ca_ledger_audit_member_net",
      "comment": "Each member's net player_wallet movement over the chip_drift range of ca_ledger_audit_marks (both sides of every leg, as fn_chip_drift_since_baseline counts them). Migration 20261022162545."
    }
  ]
}
